    "updated_at": "2023-01-16T17:18:48Z",
    "body": "I have created a negative (aka historical) test for this at https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/37994. The rationale is at https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#url-apis-elsewhere. You can pass these around as strings.\r\n\r\n(And there also hasn't been any real demand for this functionality.)",
